sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 用户
    participant Core as AG99 Core / Persona
    participant Hook as Persona 结果钩子
    participant Adapter as AG99live Adapter
    participant Motion as 独立动作 Provider
    participant TTS as Core TTS
    participant Finalizer as 输出物料化 finalizer
    participant Segments as OutputSegmentCoordinator
    participant Frontend as AG99live 前端

    U->>Core: 输入并建立 turn_id
    Core->>Core: Persona 生成 segments[].speech
    Core-->>Hook: Persona 结果 + persona_result_id
    Hook->>Adapter: 记录 (turn_id, persona_result_id, segment indexes)
    par 分段动作生成
        Hook-)Motion: 为每个非空 speech 启动动作请求
        Motion-->>Adapter: payload 或该段的失败结果
    and Core 回复物料化
        Core->>TTS: 按 Core TTS 生命周期合成 speech
        TTS-->>Adapter: message_id + tts_request_id + segment index
    end
    Adapter->>Adapter: 校验身份并按 index 绑定动作与 TTS 段
    Adapter->>Finalizer: 注册 post-materialization finalizer
    Finalizer->>Adapter: 汇合动作任务（受 Core 超时约束）
    Finalizer-->>Core: 结果物料化完成
    Core->>Segments: 交付文本、TTS 与对应动作
    Segments->>Segments: 按 turn_id/message_id 聚合，按 sequence 排序
    Segments-->>Frontend: output.segment (schema v5)
    Frontend->>Frontend: 播放音频、字幕、动作和口型
